{"parse":{"title":"List of U.S. states by Hispanic and Latino population","pageid":39477191,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux\" style=\"display:none\">Hispanic and Latino American demographics by U.S. state</div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hispanic_population_in_the_United_States_and_the_former_Mexican-American_border.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c2/Hispanic_population_in_the_United_States_and_the_former_Mexican-American_border.png/500px-Hispanic_population_in_the_United_States_and_the_former_Mexican-American_border.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"380\" height=\"242\" style=\"--mw-file-upright: 1.5\" class=\"mw-file-element mw-file-upright\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c2/Hispanic_population_in_the_United_States_and_the_former_Mexican-American_border.png/960px-Hispanic_population_in_the_United_States_and_the_former_Mexican-American_border.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1564\" data-file-height=\"996\" /></a><figcaption>The <a href=\"/wiki/Hispanic_and_Latino_Americans\" title=\"Hispanic and Latino Americans\">Hispanic and Latino American</a> proportion of population in the United States in 2010 overlaid with the Mexican–American border of 1836</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hispanics.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Hispanics.jpg/250px-Hispanics.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"154\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Hispanics.jpg/500px-Hispanics.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1201\" data-file-height=\"742\" /></a><figcaption><div style=\"text-align: center\">Proportion of Americans who are Hispanic or Latino in each U.S. state, the District of Columbia, and Puerto Rico as of the 2020 United States Census</div></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hispanics(County).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Hispanics%28County%29.jpg/250px-Hispanics%28County%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"142\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Hispanics%28County%29.jpg/500px-Hispanics%28County%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1537\" data-file-height=\"871\" /></a><figcaption><div style=\"text-align: center\">Proportion of <a href=\"/wiki/Hispanic_and_Latino_Americans\" title=\"Hispanic and Latino Americans\">Hispanic and Latino Americans</a> in each county of the <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_states_and_territories_of_the_United_States\" title=\"List of states and territories of the United States\">fifty states</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/District_of_Columbia\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"District of Columbia\">District of Columbia</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Puerto_Rico\" title=\"Puerto Rico\">Puerto Rico</a> as of the <a href=\"/wiki/2020_United_States_Census\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 United States Census\">2020 United States Census</a></div></figcaption></figure>\n<p>As of 2020, Hispanics and Latinos make up 18.7% of the total <a href=\"/wiki/Demographics_of_the_United_States\" title=\"Demographics of the United States\">U.S. population</a> (approximately 62 million out of a total of around 330 million). The state with the largest percentage of Hispanics and Latinos is <a href=\"/wiki/New_Mexico\" title=\"New Mexico\">New Mexico</a> at 47.7%. The state with the largest Hispanic and Latino population overall is <a href=\"/wiki/California\" title=\"California\">California</a> with 15.6 million Hispanics and Latinos. Hispanics are the <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_race/ethnicity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of U.S. states and territories by race/ethnicity\">largest racial or ethnic group in both states</a> and is expected to become the largest in Texas in the 2020s.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The following are lists of the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Hispanic_and_Latino_American\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hispanic and Latino American\">Hispanic and Latino</a> population</b> per <a href=\"/wiki/U.S._state\" title=\"U.S. state\">state</a> in the United States.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"2000–20_US_Census_results\"><span id=\"2000.E2.80.9320_US_Census_results\"></span>2000–20 US Census results</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=List_of_U.S._states_by_Hispanic_and_Latino_population&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: 2000–20 US Census results\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:right;\">\n<caption>Hispanic and Latino Population by state or territory (2000–2020)<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-CensusACS2019&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-CensusACS2019-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">State/Territory</th>\n<th colspan=\"3\">Numbers</th>\n<th colspan=\"3\">Per cent</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">% growth\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>2000</th>\n<th>2010</th>\n<th>2020</th>\n<th>2000</th>\n<th>2010</th>\n<th>2020</th>\n<th>2000–2010</th>\n<th>2010–2020\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alabama\" title=\"Alabama\"><img alt=\"Alabama\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Flag_of_Alabama.svg/40px-Flag_of_Alabama.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Flag_of_Alabama.svg/60px-Flag_of_Alabama.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"600\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></span>  <b><a href=\"/wiki/Alabama\" title=\"Alabama\">Alabama</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>75,830\n</td>\n<td>185,602\n</td>\n<td>264,047\n</td>\n<td>1.7%\n</td>\n<td>3.9%\n</td>\n<td>5.3%\n</td>\n<td>+144.8%\n</td>\n<td>+42.3%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alaska\" title=\"Alaska\"><img alt=\"Alaska\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Flag_of_Alaska.svg/40px-Flag_of_Alaska.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Flag_of_Alaska.svg/60px-Flag_of_Alaska.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1416\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span>  <b><a href=\"/wiki/Alaska\" title=\"Alaska\">Alaska</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>25,852\n</td>\n<td>39,250\n</td>\n<td>49,824\n</td>\n<td>4.1%\n</td>\n<td>5.5%\n</td>\n<td>6.8%\n</td>\n<td>+51.8%\n</td>\n<td>+26.9%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arizona\" title=\"Arizona\"><img alt=\"Arizona\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Flag_of_Arizona.svg/40px-Flag_of_Arizona.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Flag_of_Arizona.svg/60px-Flag_of_Arizona.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a></span></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Arizona\" title=\"Arizona\">Arizona</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>1,295,617\n</td>\n<td>1,895,149\n</td>\n<td>2,192,253\n</td>\n<td>25.3%\n</td>\n<td>29.6%\n</td>\n<td>30.7%\n</td>\n<td>+46.3%\n</td>\n<td>+15.7%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arkansas\" title=\"Arkansas\"><img alt=\"Arkansas\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Flag_of_Arkansas.svg/40px-Flag_of_Arkansas.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Flag_of_Arkansas.svg/60px-Flag_of_Arkansas.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"450\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Arkansas\" title=\"Arkansas\">Arkansas</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>86,866\n</td>\n<td>186,050\n</td>\n<td>256,847\n</td>\n<td>3.2%\n</td>\n<td>6.4%\n</td>\n<td>8.5%\n</td>\n<td>+114.2%\n</td>\n<td>+38.1%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/California\" title=\"California\"><img alt=\"California\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Flag_of_California.svg/40px-Flag_of_California.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Flag_of_California.svg/60px-Flag_of_California.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a></span></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/California\" title=\"California\">California</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>10,966,556\n</td>\n<td>14,013,719\n</td>\n<td>15,579,652\n</td>\n<td>32.4%\n</td>\n<td>37.6%\n</td>\n<td>39.4%\n</td>\n<td>+27.8%\n</td>\n<td>+11.2%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Colorado\" title=\"Colorado\"><img alt=\"Colorado\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Flag_of_Colorado.svg/40px-Flag_of_Colorado.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Flag_of_Colorado.svg/60px-Flag_of_Colorado.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1800\" data-file-height=\"1200\" /></a></span></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Colorado\" title=\"Colorado\">Colorado</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>735,801\n</td>\n<td>1,038,687\n</td>\n<td>1,263,390\n</td>\n<td>17.1%\n</td>\n<td>20.7%\n</td>\n<td>21.9%\n</td>\n<td>+41.2%\n</td>\n<td>+21.6%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Connecticut\" title=\"Connecticut\"><img alt=\"Connecticut\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Flag_of_Connecticut.svg/20px-Flag_of_Connecticut.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Flag_of_Connecticut.svg/40px-Flag_of_Connecticut.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"330\" data-file-height=\"260\" /></a></span></span>  <b><a href=\"/wiki/Connecticut\" title=\"Connecticut\">Connecticut</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>320,323\n</td>\n<td>479,087\n</td>\n<td>623,293\n</td>\n<td>9.4%\n</td>\n<td>13.4%\n</td>\n<td>17.3%\n</td>\n<td>+49.6%\n</td>\n<td>+30.1%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Delaware\" title=\"Delaware\"><img alt=\"Delaware\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Flag_of_Delaware.svg/40px-Flag_of_Delaware.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Flag_of_Delaware.svg/60px-Flag_of_Delaware.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"600\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></span>  <b><a href=\"/wiki/Delaware\" title=\"Delaware\">Delaware</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>37,277\n</td>\n<td>73,221\n</td>\n<td>104,290\n</td>\n<td>4.8%\n</td>\n<td>8.2%\n</td>\n<td>10.5%\n</td>\n<td>+96.4%\n</td>\n<td>+42.4%\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr style=\"background:#f5f5d3\">\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Washington,_D.C.\" title=\"Washington, D.C.\"><img alt=\"Washington, D.C.\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Flag_of_Washington%2C_D.C.svg/40px-Flag_of_Washington%2C_D.C.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Flag_of_Washington%2C_D.C.svg/60px-Flag_of_Washington%2C_D.C.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2000\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/District_of_Columbia\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"District of Columbia\">District of Columbia</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>44,953\n</td>\n<td>54,749\n</td>\n<td>77,652\n</td>\n<td>7.9%\n</td>\n<td>9.1%\n</td>\n<td>11.3%\n</td>\n<td>+21.8%\n</td>\n<td>+41.8%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Florida\" title=\"Florida\"><img alt=\"Florida\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Flag_of_Florida.svg/40px-Flag_of_Florida.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Flag_of_Florida.svg/60px-Flag_of_Florida.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"4500\" data-file-height=\"3000\