ish-speaking</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_educational_attainment\" title=\"List of U.S. states and territories by educational attainment\">Educational attainment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_largest_cities_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_population\" title=\"List of largest cities of U.S. states and territories by population\">Largest cities by population</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_median_age\" title=\"List of U.S. states and territories by median age\">Median age</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_most_popular_given_names_by_state_in_the_United_States\" title=\"List of most popular given names by state in the United States\">Most popular given names</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_the_most_populous_counties_by_U.S._state\" title=\"List of the most populous counties by U.S. state\">Most populous counties</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_net_migration\" title=\"List of U.S. states and territories by net migration\">Net migration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lists_of_populated_places_in_the_United_States\" title=\"Lists of populated places in the United States\">Populated places</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_cities_by_population_density#States_and_territories\" title=\"List of United States cities by population density\">Population density (cities)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_Race_/_Ethnicity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"List of U.S. states and territories by Race / Ethnicity\">Race/ethnicity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_religiosity\" title=\"List of U.S. states and territories by religiosity\">Religiosity</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Irreligion_in_the_United_States#Demographics\" title=\"Irreligion in the United States\">irreligion</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\" 